<view class="page-shell tab-page companion-shell" style="{{statusBarStyle}}">
  <text class="eyebrow">说话风格</text>
  <text class="page-title">角色</text>
  <text class="page-lede">换个说话风格。它始终是陪孩子聊天、讲故事的 AI 助手。</text>

  <view class="role-grid">
    <view
      wx:for="{{cards}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="role-card {{profile.companion_id === item.id ? 'role-card-on' : ''}}"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="chooseCompanion"
    >
      <view class="role-art">
        <view class="role-fig"><face-badge role="{{item.id}}" size="lg" plain="{{true}}"></face-badge></view>
      </view>
      <text class="role-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="role-tagline">{{item.tagline}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{profile.companion_id === item.id}}" class="pill pill-online role-chip">正在使用</view>
      <view wx:else class="pill pill-neutral role-chip">切换</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="role-new" bindtap="openCustomPersona">
    <image class="role-new-icon" src="/assets/ui/v4/plus-accent.svg" aria-hidden="true"></image>
    <text>新建角色</text>
  </view>
  <text class="caption role-hint">换角色后，机器人下一次对话起换成 TA 的声音。</text>

  <text class="section-title">声音</text>
  <view class="card companion-voice">
    <view class="setting-row">
      <mp-icon name="volume"></mp-icon>
      <view class="row-copy">
        <text class="row-title">角色默认声音</text>
        <text class="row-meta">{{currentName}} · {{currentTone}}</text>
      </view>
      <view
        class="pill pill-teal role-play"
        data-id="{{profile.companion_id}}"
        catchtap="togglePreview"
      >{{previewingId === profile.companion_id ? '停止' : '试听'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="privacy-note">角色只影响表达风格，不改变你的资料权限。角色音色来自产品设计音色。</text>
</view>
